  "body": "Looking for a way into Takapuna with land, space and options for the future? This could be it.\r\n\r\nSet on a 638sqm freehold site, 6 Burns Avenue offers something increasingly hard to find in central Takapuna - a Legal Home & Income, six bedrooms in total, double garage, plenty of off-street parking and genuine potential to add value over time.\r\n\r\nThe main home provides five bedrooms, while the separate self-contained one-bedroom unit gives you valuable flexibility for extended family, teenagers, guests, working from home, or potential additional income.\r\n\r\nRather than paying a premium for somebody else's renovation, secure the location and the land first. Move in, make it your own and improve it over time to suit your family, your style and your budget.\r\n\r\nAnd the value isn't only in today's home.\r\n\r\nThe 638sqm site is zoned Residential - Terrace Housing and Apartment Buildings (THAB), with an existing concept plan exploring the potential for up to six terrace homes, subject to Auckland Council approval and all necessary consents.\r\nYou don't need to develop it today - but it's good to know the option is there for the future.\r\n\r\nThe location is a major part of the appeal. The property is in zone for Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls' High School, providing excellent schooling options from primary through to secondary level.\r\n\r\nTakapuna Beach, the town centre, Shore City, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, parks and public transport are all close by, with convenient access to the CBD and wider North Shore.\r\n\r\nThis is a property that gives you something increasingly valuable in Takapuna - choices.\r\n\r\nLive in it. Improve it. Enjoy the Home & Income. Hold the land. Keep your options open for the future. Come and see what 638sqm in Takapuna could mean for you.\r\n\r\nCall Yolanda Ma on 021 668 077 or Lee Li on 021 834 888 to arrange your viewing. All conjunctions welcome.",
